---
title: "create_currency (Sui Framework: coin)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_otw: is_one_time_witness(witness)
    q_validate_otw --> q_abort: not OTW
    q_abort --> [*]: abort EBadWitness
    q_validate_otw --> q_create_supply: valid OTW
    q_create_supply --> q_create_cap: supply = create_supply(witness)
    q_create_cap --> q_create_metadata: TreasuryCap(supply)
    q_create_metadata --> [*]: return (TreasuryCap, CoinMetadata)

    note right of q_validate_otw
        INV-001: only one-time witness types can create currency (singleton guarantee)
        INV-002: exactly one TreasuryCap per type T exists
        INV-003: initial total_supply is 0
    end note
